// ============================================================================
// Structured financial terms per scheme — the numbers the calculation engine
// is allowed to use. Nothing here is generated by AI.
//
// PROVENANCE. Each term is tagged:
//   'repo'      — taken from the scheme's own fields/text in data/schemes.js
//   'guideline' — from the scheme's published operational guidelines; the UI
//                 tells the user to confirm these with the bank/portal
// Anything not known is left null/'unspecified' and the engine reports it as
// unknown rather than guessing. In particular NO interest rate is ever invented
// for a scheme that says "bank's normal rate".
//
// Money is in rupees. Percentages are plain numbers (25 = 25%).
// ============================================================================

